{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie God: a Roguelite/RTS spin\u00a0on the \u2019God Game\u2019 genre. Unleash your inner deity and command your undead minions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/851b14970970ec2be89935b0421218c5.gif?t=1761589979\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/851b14970970ec2be89935b0421218c5.poster.avif?t=1761589979\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn special zombies and use your unholy abilities to overcome the desperate defences of the survivors. Use resources gathered to upgrade your zombies' DNA and craft the perfect loadout to tackle increasingly difficult levels and NG+ modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.poster.avif?t=1761589979\" width=628 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.webm?t=1761589979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/3c1924ffb10aaedc1496da6f66d46ace.mp4?t=1761589979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume civilians, police and army to gather resources. Weave your way around airstrikes, landmines and mortar teams.\u00a0Dismantle APCs and tanks with your giant horde and watch as the challenge keeps increasing as humans counter your invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.poster.avif?t=1761589979\" width=629 height=59 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.webm?t=1761589979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your fellow shamblers in worship in the official Zombie God Discord &amp; subreddit where you will find news, updates, memes and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie God combines Roguelite, Strategy and God Game into a unique blend, featuring the following:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command hordes of zombies in real-time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special zombies and abilities to destroy a level's defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and upgrade your zombies with roguelite meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an upgrade path for each of your zombies by modifying their DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities and new zombie types through level rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat a series of increasingly difficult levels through NG+</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035320?t=1761589979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761589979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761589979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761589979","categories":[{"description