e challenge keeps increasing as humans counter your invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.poster.avif?t=1761589979\" width=629 height=59 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/f2006f67241ad7e985d54741d1b9e38e.webm?t=1761589979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your fellow shamblers in worship in the official Zombie God Discord &amp; subreddit where you will find news, updates, memes and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie God combines Roguelite, Strategy and God Game into a unique blend, featuring the following:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command hordes of zombies in real-time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special zombies and abilities to destroy a level's defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and upgrade your zombies with roguelite meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an upgrade path for each of your zombies by modifying their DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities and new zombie types through level rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat a series of increasingly difficult levels through NG+</p></li></ul>","developers":["Codematik"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/283618ccd93ab80192759292164e242780bee48a/header.jpg?t=1761589979","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"da